' Selecting one of your own, and what the location menu does with him:
' STAY THERE, REJOIN (with the Abandon question, answered no and then yes),
' DISMISS of a companion, and DISMISS of the last camper (the Dismiss
' question). The start is group_part.script's: two men hired in New Sandez,
' the walk to Bearwoods.
mapclick 75,303          ' walk into New Sandez
clickon 248              ' walk up to a mercenary, wherever he has wandered, and ask
hire                     ' he takes the meat
trade                    ' walk over to the trader, who waits for you
trade
uiclick 204,211           ' the canteen out of the pack, keeping the knife
uiclick 318,128          ' for a meat off the trader's table
deal                     ' a deal closes the table by itself
esc                      ' the trader's scene stays after a deal (OnButtonAccept); leave it
clickon 63               ' and a second mercenary, paid with that meat
hire
esc                      ' back out onto the world map, the group with you
mapclick 61,355          ' sets out; the days on the road pass by themselves (v0.9.1 skips a travelling player's turns)
mapclick 61,355          ' in, all of you at the entry
mapclick 300,120         ' walk in among the dogs
wait 150                 ' and let the group settle round you
clickfriend 1             ' select him: single mode, he is the one who walks
wait 5
mapclick 330,160          ' he walks there, the leader stays
wait 60
menu 320,150
menuline 4                ' STAY THERE: Bearwoods is ours, and he is still selected
wait 10
menu 320,150
menuline 4                ' REJOIN: the last one out, so the Abandon question
wait 5
talkline 1                ' "No, stay where you are."
wait 10
clickfriend 2             ' the other man
wait 5
menu 320,150
menuline 3                ' DISMISS: out of the group, where he stands
wait 10
clickon 248               ' the camper, standing in the place: selected
wait 5
save                      ' the cut, here too
menu 320,150
menuline 2                ' DISMISS the last camper (no ALL now: the group is the leader alone)
wait 5
talkline 0                ' "If you fire me you'll regret it…": the page turns
wait 3
talkline 2                ' yes: he goes, and Bearwoods is nobody's
wait 10
save
